  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Sea La Vie is located at Inlet Beach and is about a five minute walk to the world's most beautiful beaches in Florida. (See pictures for map and aerial view). Cottage beach style upscale home can easily accommodate and sleep 8 people in this 3 bedroom 2.5 bath (link to 3D view of home in owner's info). 1705 square feet is all for you and your guests to enjoy. Inlet Beach is known for it's quiet and uncrowded beaches but right next door to all the great shops and restaurants along 30A, Rosemary Beach, Alys Beach & Seacrest. Come and enjoy this beautifully decorated and comfortable home.<br><br>Renters must be age 25 or older unless you message me first please No smoking or vaping allowed in or near the house ($500 fee). Sorry no pets due to allergies. No parties or events.<br><br>Beach chairs and sand toys available to use and beach cart to carry all your stuff.<br><br>Security cameras (Nest) front door and back door for your security and ours. <br> <br>Entry code for front door. No need to meet<br> manager for check-in<br>https://youtu.be/",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
